   <description>
      <p>
         <b>NukeX Update Repository</b>
      </p>
      <p>
         Intelligent region-aware processing for PixInsight by Scott Carter.
      </p>
      <p>
         <b>MOVED:</b> NukeX now ships from the unified astro-pi repository. Please register https://raw.githubusercontent.com/scarter4work/astro-pi/main/repository/ to receive NukeX 5.0.0 and future updates.
      </p>
